    "code": " def read_ints():\n\n    return map(int, input().split())\n\nn, m = read_ints()\n\nif m >= n:\n\n    print(n)\n\n    exit()\n\nk = n - m\n\nlow = 0\n\nhigh = 2 * k * (k + 1) + 1\n\nwhile high - low > 1:\n\n    mid = (low + high) // 2\n\n    triangular = mid * (mid + 1) // 2\n\n    if k <= triangular:\n\n        high = mid\n\n    else:\n\n        low = mid\n\nprint(high + m)",
